James is putting tables together. Each table has 4 legs. So, 4 tables have 4 * 4 = 16 legs. Each leg needs 2 screws. So, 16 legs need 16 * 2 = 32 screws. James has 40 screws. The number of screws left over is 40 - 32 = 8 screws.
\boxed{8}

